lapigo.yaml:6:12: sort key "price" has type "decimal", which may not be a sort key
   6 |     sort: [price]
     |            ^^^^^
   decimal values are not safely comparable through a JSON-encoded cursor; remove `price` from `sort` (spec §3.3 rule 4)

lapigo.yaml:6:12: warning: sort key "price" may change after the row is created
   6 |     sort: [price]
     |            ^^^^^
   a row whose sort value changes can move relative to a live cursor; this is inherent to keyset pagination and does not block generation. Mark `price` `immutable: true` if its value must never change once set (spec §3.3 rule 5)